WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.279
Today we will compose a simple shared musical phrase. Our work connects with

00:00:05.279 --> 00:00:06.451
communities across Africa.

00:00:07.283 --> 00:00:10.761
Write or say a short call about caring for people or places.

00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:14.198
Invent an easy response of similar length.

00:00:15.617 --> 00:00:20.414
Practise taking turns as leader and responding group. Explain one respectful

00:00:20.414 --> 00:00:23.467
similarity or difference with another African example.
